### FitNest Gym - Locker Room Management REST API (Group ID: YG-CSE2E-G01)
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Root Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Get All Active Lockers (Excludes Soft Deleted)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lockers

### 3. Search/Filter Lockers by Floor
GET {{baseUrl}}/lockers?floor=2

### 4. Get Locker by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/lockers/12

### 5. Create a New Locker
POST {{baseUrl}}/lockers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Locker 501",
  "floor": 5
}

### 6. Update Locker
PUT {{baseUrl}}/lockers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Locker 101 (Renovated)",
  "floor": 1
}

### 7. Twist 1: Soft Delete Locker 12
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lockers/12

### 8. Twist 1: Verify Locker 12 is Hidden (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lockers/12

### 9. Twist 1: Restore Locker 12
POST {{baseUrl}}/lockers/12/restore

### 10. Twist 1: Verify Locker 12 is Back (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lockers/12

### 11. Get All Members
GET {{baseUrl}}/members

### 12. Get Member by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/1

### 13. Create Member
POST {{baseUrl}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arjun Das",
  "phone": "9876543299",
  "email": "arjun@fitnest.com"
}

### 14. Create Allotment (Starts as pending)
POST {{baseUrl}}/allotments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "member_id": 4,
  "locker_id": 12
}

### 15. Prevent Duplicate Active Allotment (Returns 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/allotments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "member_id": 5,
  "locker_id": 12
}

### 16. Relational JOIN Query: Allotment Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/allotments/details

### 17. Twist 2: Status Flow pending -> approved (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/allotments/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved"
}

### 18. Twist 2: Backward status move rejected (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/allotments/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "pending"
}
